      "content": "i hear you, but it's hard to see it that way. it just feels so much more selfless to just... let go. like, if i could just step out of the way, i'd finally be doing something right for once. doing something that actually helps them instead of hurting them. wouldn't it be kinder to just stop being the problem?",
